msgid ""
"Stand alone version for use with KDM or XDM.\n"
"You should Add : kvkbd --loginhelper to Xsetup and\n"
"qdbus org.kde.kvkbd /MainApplication quit to Xstartup to run in xdm/kdm"
msgstr ""
"Versión independente para empregar con KDM ou XDM.\n"
"Debera engadir: kvkbd --loginhelper en Xsetup e\n"
"qdbus org.kde.kvkbd /MainApplication quit en Xstartup para executall en xdm/"
"kdm"

